THE ONE THING THE AUDIENCE MUST FEEL: {{ scene.must_feel }}
THIS SCENE'S PLEASURE AND ENERGY TARGET: {{ scene.pleasure_type }} / {{ scene.energy_target }}
{% if scene.set_piece %}
